{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SH","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI14SymbolVariantsV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SymbolVariants","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SymbolVariants"}],"title":"SymbolVariants","symbolKind":"struct"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SymbolVariants","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Many of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/sf-symbols"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that you can add to your app using an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Image","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Label","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have common variants, like a filled version or a version that’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contained within a circle. The symbol’s name indicates the variant:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["VStack(alignment: .leading) {","    Label(\"Default\", systemImage: \"heart\")","